Package: rnaparallel
Type: Package
Title: Parallel Companions for RNA-Seq Tools
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("GenomeRx", role = c("aut", "cph"),
           comment = "author of the parallel companion"),
    person("Nam", "Nguyen", email = "namnguyenhk@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yuqing", "Zhang", role = "ctb",
           comment = "author of ComBat-seq, accelerated but not modified by this package"),
    person("Giovanni", "Parmigiani", role = "ctb", comment = "author of ComBat-seq"),
    person("W. Evan", "Johnson", role = "ctb", comment = "author of ComBat-seq"))
Description: Parallel companions for RNA-seq tools. Each calls the original
    function unmodified, with hot paths rebound to row-parallel versions in a
    child of that function's own environment, so the result is identical()
    to a serial run rather than merely close to it. Covers ComBat-seq
    (against Bioconductor sva or a sourced upstream copy), limma lmFit and
    duplicateCorrelation, and edgeR normLibSizes. Dispatches through
    mclapply, future, BiocParallel, foreach or serial.
